      "text": "7. Browser validates + displays the result\nProduct identity and original pack size\nDated prices, location, currency and source links\nWarn when observations are older than 90 days\nStock on hand = Unknown\nSource failure remains visible; no silent success",
      "originalText": "7. Browser validates + displays the result\nProduct identity and original pack size\nDated prices, location, currency and source links\nWarn when observations are older than 90 days\nStock on hand = Unknown\nSource failure remains visible; no silent success",
