      "text": "Response context and limits\nSource IDs, URLs, record dates, lookup time\nCached records can be older than lookup time\nCommunity contributions may be inaccurate\nNo price-match approval or inventory join\nClient wait cap: 20s; Cancel stops waiting",
      "originalText": "Response context and limits\nSource IDs, URLs, record dates, lookup time\nCached records can be older than lookup time\nCommunity contributions may be inaccurate\nNo price-match approval or inventory join\nClient wait cap: 20s; Cancel stops waiting",
